# 6️⃣ Traveling Salesman Problem (TSP)

## Problem

Visit every city once.

Return to source.

Minimum Cost.

---

### State

```cpp
dp[node][mask]
```

Meaning:

```text
Current City

Visited Cities
```

---

### Recurrence

Try all unvisited cities.

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N² × 2ᴺ)
```

---

